    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join one of the most iconic characters of Negas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will follow Pinchimono's story, where you will have to help him get his precious pizza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this world full of challenges, challenging battles and above all, a great mix of everything that is the Negas universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/21a6367f34dcff67fc9743e12d6c5cd1.poster.avif?t=1747169485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/21a6367f34dcff67fc9743e12d6c5cd1.webm?t=1747169485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/21a6367f34dcff67fc9743e12d6c5cd1.mp4?t=1747169485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INCREDIBLE AND CHALLENGING BATTLES AT ALL LEVELS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/95d4717963afe94f7b93da3d6cddf78c.poster.avif?t=1747169485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/95d4717963afe94f7b93da3d6cddf78c.webm?t=1747169485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/95d4717963afe94f7b93da3d6cddf78c.mp4?t=1747169485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE YOUR MUSCLES AND THROW OBJECTS AROUND THE STAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ITEMS AND MANY MORE MECHANICS AWAIT YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/8e20d9cbeacbf71a13d6ae2c06b122da.poster.avif?t=1747169485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/8e20d9cbeacbf71a13d6ae2c06b122da.webm?t=1747169485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441150/extras/8e20d9cbeacbf71a13d6ae2c06b122da.mp4?t=1747169485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
